Ii sharax oo i tus koodhka loogu xiro Maktabadda Dhijitaalka ah Firebase Authentication, Firestore, Storage, iyo Realtime Online/Offline status.

Si Maktabadda Dhijitaalka ah ay u shaqeyso si dhab ah oo loogu publish gareeyo meel kasta, waxaan beddelaynaa kaydintii ku tiirsanayd localStorage oo waxaan ku xiraynaa afar adeeg oo Firebase ah:

Firebase Authentication: Diiwaangelinta (Sign Up) iyo gelitaanka (Log In) isticmaalayaasha.

Cloud Firestore: Kaydinta xogta buugagga (books), xogta isticmaalayaasha iyo doorka (users oo leh role: "admin" ama "user"), iyo buugagga la jecleysiiyay (favorites).

Firebase Storage: Kaydinta faylasha buugagga (PDF, EPUB, iwm.) iyo sawirrada jaldiga (coverUrl).

Realtime Database (Presence): La socodka dadka hadda Online ah iyo waqtigii ugu dambeeyay ee ay Offline noqdeen (lastSeen).

1. Qaabka Xogta (Data Structure) ee Firestore & Realtime DB
