Maxaad Ka Arkaysaa Maktabadda Hadda?
Bogga Gelitaanka (Log In / Sign Up): Waxaad geli kartaa akoon tijaabo ah oo Reader ah ama Admin ah, ama waxaad is-diiwaangelin kartaa (Sign Up).

Maktabadda Buugagga: Waxaad ka dhex raadin kartaa buugagga, waad shaandhayn kartaa qaybaha, waadna ku dari kartaa Favorites.

Akhristaha Gudaha (Online Reader) & Soo Dejinta: Waxaad ka akhrisan kartaa buugagga gudaha bogga adigoo beddelaya Light / Sepia / Dark iyo cabbirka farta, ama waad soo dejisan kartaa.

Qaybta Admin (marka aad gasho akoon Admin ah): Waxaad ku dari kartaa buug cusub oo leh sawir jaldi ah (Cover Image) iyo faylka buugga, waxaadna arki kartaa liiska isticmaalayaasha iyo xaaladdooda Online / Offline.

Wey igu adkaatey in aan sameyo, ma ii sameyn karta fadlan!

Waan kuu dhisayaa faylka dhammaystiran ee Maktabadda Dhijitaalka ah (maktabadda_online.html) oo leh muuqaal qurxoon, CSS dhammaystiran, Log In / Sign Up leh kala saaridda Admin vs Reader, akhris online ah (oo ay ku jirto horudhaca PDF/faylasha), soo dejin, qaybta Admin ee soo gelinta buugagga cusub (oo leh sawir jaldi ah iyo faylka buugga) iyo la socodka Users & Online/Offline, isla markaana u shaqaynaya si degdeg ah Demo / Local Mode iyo Firebase Cloud Mode marka aad geliso furayaashaada Firebase.

Maktabadda Dhijitaalka ah



Waxaan kuu dhisay Maktabadda Dhijitaalka ah (maktabadda_online.html) oo hal fayl ah:

Labada Qaab (Dual Mode): Wuxuu si toos ah ugu shaqaynayaa Qaabka Tijaabada (Local) markiiba, wuxuuna leeyahay FIREBASE_CONFIG oo si toos ah ugu wareegaya Firebase Cloud Mode (Auth, Firestore, Storage, iyo Realtime Database presence) marka aad geliso furayaashaada.

Kala Saaridda Doorka (admin vs user): Waxaad isku tijaabin kartaa badhamada "Ku gal Reader (Akhriste)" iyo "Ku gal Admin (Maamule)", iyadoo qaybta Geli Buug, tirtiridda buugagga, iyo Users & Online/Offline ay u furan yihiin Admin keliya.

Akhristaha Online-ka & Soo Dejinta: Waxaad beddeli kartaa Cad / Sepia / Madow iyo cabbirka farta, waadna furi kartaa horudhaca PDF/faylasha (<iframe>) ama waad soo dejisan kartaa.

Firbass ayaan ku xiri rabaa, maxan sameya

Waa arrin aad u fudud—waad ku mahadsan tahay sida aad ula socoto! Si aad Maktabadda Dhijitaalka ah ugu xirto Firebase, raac tallaabooyinkan fudud ee hoose mid mid:

Tallaabada 1: Samee Mashruuc Cusub oo Firebase Ah
Gal Firebase Console oo ku gal akoonkaaga Google.

Guji Create a project (ama Add project), u bixi magac (tusaale: maktabadda-online), kadibna dhammaystir abuurista mashruuca.

Tallaabada 2: Daar Afarta Adeeg ee Muhiimka Ah
Gudaha mashruucaaga Firebase, daar adeegyadan:

Authentication: Aaad Build -> Authentication -> Get started, dooro Email/Password, kadibna daar (Enable) oo kaydi.

Firestore Database: Aaad Build -> Firestore Database -> Create database. Dooro qaabka Start in test mode bilowga (ama ku dar xeerarkii Security Rules ee aynu hore u qornay), kadibna abuur.

Storage: Aaad Build -> Storage -> Get started, dooro Start in test mode bilowga, kadibna dhammaystir.

Realtime Database: Aaad Build -> Realtime Database -> Create Database (waxaa loo isticmaalaa la socodka Online / Offline), dooro Start in test mode bilowga, kadibna abuur.

Tallaabada 3: Qaado Furayaasha firebaseConfig
Guji calaamadda Settings (Gear icon) ee ku taal dhinaca sare ee bidixda -> Project settings.

Hoosta u deg ilaa qaybta Your apps, haddii aadan lahayn Web app guji calaamadda </> (Web), magac u bixi, kadibna koobi garee xogta ku jirta firebaseConfig (sida apiKey, authDomain, databaseURL, projectId, storageBucket, messagingSenderId, appId).

Tallaabada 4: Geli Furayaasha Gudaha Koodhkaaga
Fur faylkaaga maktabadda_online.html ama koodhkaaga JavaScript ee Firebase.

Raadi qaybta firebaseConfig (ama FIREBASE_CONFIG), kadibna ku beddel qiimayaasha "YOUR_..." furayaasha dhabta ah ee aad ka soo qaadatay Firebase Console.

Kaydi faylka (Save).

Tallaabada 5: Ka Dhig Akoonkaaga Ugu Horreeya "Admin"
Fur website-kaaga oo is-diiwaangeli (Sign Up) adigoo isticmaalaya email-kaaga iyo password-kaaga.

Ku noqo Firebase Console -> Firestore Database -> users.

Fur document-ga leh magaca/ID-ga akoonkaaga, ka beddel goobta role oo ka dhig "admin" (halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd "user"), kadibna guji Update.

Dib u cusboonaysii (Refresh) bogga maktabadda—waxaad markiiba arki doontaa awoodda Admin (soo gelinta buugagga, tirtiridda, iyo liiska isticmaalayaasha oo leh xaaladda Online / Offline).

Talo Degdeg Ah
Haddii aad rabto inaan kugu caawiyo oo aan kuu qoro koodhka dhammaystiran ee hal fayl ah oo ay ku dhan yihiin Firebase Auth, Firestore, Storage, iyo Realtime Database si ay markiiba u wada shaqeeyaan marka aad geliso furayaashaada, ii sheeg!

Wan ku xirey

Mabruuk! Waad ku mahadsan tahay dadaalkaaga—hadda oo aad ku xirtay Firebase, maktabaddaadu waxay u gudubtay marxalad dhab ah oo xogtu ku kaydsan tahay cloud-ka.

Si aad u hubiso in wax walba ay si habboon u shaqaynayaan kahor inta aadan dadka kale la wadaagin, halkan waxaa ku yaalla liiska hubinta degdegga ah (Quick Verification Checklist):

1. Hubi Diiwaangelinta & Role-ka Admin-ka
Is-diiwaangeli (Sign Up) adigoo isticmaalaya akoonkaaga, kadibna Firestore Database -> users ka hubi in document-gaagu uu leeyahay role: "admin".

Dib u cusboonaysii (Refresh) bogga si aad u hubiso in badhanka/qaybta Geli Buug (Admin) iyo liiska isticmaalayaasha ay kuu furmeen.

2. Tijaabi Soo Gelinta Buug, Akhriska, & Soo Dejinta
Ku dar buug tijaabo ah adigoo gelinaya sawir jaldi ah (cover) iyo fayl (sida PDF ama TXT).

Ka hubi Firebase Storage in sawirka iyo faylka buuggu ay galeen folders-ka saxda ah (covers/ iyo books/), isla markaana Firestore -> books uu ku kordhay document-kii buugga.

Tijaabi badhanka Akhri Online iyo Soo Deji si aad u xaqiijiso in link-yadu si sax ah u furmayaan.

3. Tijaabi Xaaladda Online / Offline
Fur bogga maktabadda oo ka hubi Realtime Database -> status/{uid} in online uu isu beddelay true.

Xir tab-ka ama browser-ka (ama ka bax akoonka), kadibna eeg haddii online uu noqday false oo uu cusboonaysiiyay lastSeen.

4. Xeerarka Ammaanka Kahor Daabicidda (Publish)
Haddii aad adeegyada Firebase ku daartay Test mode, xusuusnow inaad ku beddesho Firestore Rules iyo Storage Rules xaddidan (sida qofka soo galay oo kaliya inuu wax akhriyo, admin-kana uu wax qoro/tirtiro) kahor inta aadan dadweyne u furin.

Ma waxaa jira qalad (error) ama fariin digniin ah oo kuu soo baxday marka aad tijaabinaysay, mise wax walba si fiican ayay kuu shaqaynayaan?

