Step by step

Waa kuwan tallaabo-tallaabo (Step by Step) sida aad ugu dhaqangelin karto saddexda qaab ee ay maktabaddaadu u yeelan karto la xiriirka Download—iyadoo mid walba si cad loo kala saaray si aad u qaadato kan aad rabto:

Qaabka 1: Ka Saaridda Download-ka (Akhris Gudaha Ah Kaliya)
1
Fur faylka maktabadda (HTML/JS)
Ku fur maktabadda_online.html ama editor-kaaga koodhka (sida VS Code).

2
