Prompt-ka maktabada.so (Koobi Garee)
Dhiso web application casri ah oo magaciisu yahay maktabada.so, waana maktabad dhijitaal ah oo Af-Soomaali leh naqshad nadiif ah oo ku habboon kombiyuutarka iyo taleefanka.

1. Gelitaanka & Doorarka (Auth & Roles):

Samee nidaam Log In iyo Sign Up (email iyo password) oo kala saaraya admin iyo user (Reader).

Marka qof cusub is-diiwaangeliyo, wuxuu helaa doorka user. Qofka admin-ka ah wuxuu leeyahay awoodda soo gelinta buugagga, tirtiridda buugagga, iyo aragtida liiska isticmaalayaasha.

2. Maktabadda Buugagga, Akhriska, & Favorites:

Bandhig kaararka buugagga oo leh sawirka jaldiga (cover), cinwaanka, qoraaga, qaybta (category oo ay ku jirto qayb gaar ah oo la qori karo), iyo faahfaahin kooban.

Ku dar raadin degdeg ah (search), shaandhaynta qaybaha, iyo badhanka Favorites si akhristuhu u kaydsado buugagga uu jecel yahay.

Samee Online Reader gudaha bogga ah oo leh beddelidda muuqaalka (Light / Sepia / Dark), cabbirka farta, iyo horudhaca faylasha (PDF / qoraal), iyadoo si cad loo kala saarayo haddii buuggu leeyahay Download ama uu yahay akhris gudaha ah.

3. Qaybta Admin (Geli Buug & Users Online/Offline):

Foom lagu soo geliyo buug cusub oo leh sawirka jaldiga iyo faylka buugga (PDF/EPUB/TXT), iyadoo la muujinayo horudhac (preview) ka hor kaydinta.

Kaar ama qayb Users & Live Status oo muujinaysa tirada isticmaalayaasha, inta Online ah, liiska isticmaalayaasha (Name, Email, Role, Favorites), iyo xaaladda Online / Offline ee tooska ah (Realtime Presence) iyo waqtigii ugu dambeeyay (Last Seen).

4. Ku Xiridda Firebase (maktada-1d6f0):

Ku xir Firebase Authentication, Cloud Firestore (users iyo books), Firebase Storage (covers/ iyo books/), iyo Realtime Database (status/{uid} oo leh onDisconnect).

Ku dar naqshad CSS dhammaystiran oo hal fayl (index.html) ama qaab nadiif ah oo diyaar u ah in lagu publish gareeyo Firebase Hosting ama Vercel ee maktabada.so.

